 of a tp_doc that begins with \"name(sig)\\n--\\n\\n\""] [1194 1 "// (\"\" for none)."] [1207 1 "// docWithoutSignature is _PyType_DocWithoutSignature: tp_doc less its \"name(sig)\\n--\\n\\n\" signature."] [1220 1 "// addCMethods puts the PyMethodDefs of the table at defs in the type's dict: methods bound to the instance (self"] [1221 1 "// first), class methods (METH_CLASS) and static methods (METH_STATIC); METH_METHOD's get the type as defining_class."] [1231 33 "// METH_STATIC: no self"] [1249 13 "// a slot wrapper's name: the first one stays (METH_COEXIST not set)"] [1256 1 "// addCMembers makes each member of the type's tp_members a member descriptor reading or writing the instance's"] [1257 1 "// memory (PyMember_GetOne, PyMember_SetOne); __dictoffset__ and __weaklistoffset__ are the type's sizes instead."] [1278 31 "// not Py_READONLY"] [1291 1 "// addCGetSets makes each PyGetSetDef (name, get, set, doc, closure) of the table at defs a getset descriptor that"] [1292 1 "// calls C."] [1324 1 "// ---- PyMember_GetOne, PyMember_SetOne (Python/structmember.c) ----"] [1326 1 "// memberGet is PyMember_GetOne for the PyMemberDef at mb over the object at addr."] [1334 11 "// Py_T_BOOL"] [1336 10 "// Py_T_BYTE"] [1338 10 "// Py_T_UBYTE"] [1340 10 "// Py_T_SHORT"] [1342 11 "// Py_T_USHORT"] [1344 10 "// Py_T_INT"] [1346 11 "// Py_T_UINT"] [1348 18 "// Py_T_LONG, Py_T_LONGLONG, Py_T_PYSSIZET"] [1350 15 "// Py_T_ULONG, Py_T_ULONGLONG"] [1352 10 "// Py_T_FLOAT"] [1354 10 "// Py_T_DOUBLE"] [1356 10 "// Py_T_STRING"] [1361 11 "// Py_T_STRING_INPLACE"] [1363 10 "// Py_T_CHAR"] [1365 10 "// _Py_T_OBJECT"] [1370 11 "// Py_T_OBJECT_EX"] [1380 11 "// _Py_T_NONE"] [1394 1 "// memberSet is PyMember_SetOne for the PyMemberDef at mb over the object at addr (v nil: delete)."] [1434 11 "// Py_T_BOOL"] [1444 23 "// Py_T_BYTE, Py_T_UBYTE, Py_T_SHORT, Py_T_USHORT, Py_T_INT"] [1476 11 "// Py_T_UINT"] [1480 14 "// Py_T_LONG, Py_T_LONGLONG"] [1486 15 "// Py_T_ULONG, Py_T_ULONGLONG"] [1495 1